 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >欢迎收看电视上最致命的节目</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted House Hellshift 是一款节奏飞快、混乱刺激的俯视角射击游戏。你要一路杀出一座闹鬼的宅邸，而电视机前的观众正在收看现场直播。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >射杀怪物、躲避陷阱、收集眼球打开上锁的门、寻找新武器，然后想办法活着出去。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可以独自游玩，也可以和朋友在同一台电脑上一起玩。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/5548a812a85610be2e9f01205ae6da05.poster.avif?t=1788537373\" aria-label=\"Scene showing 2 player local co-op mode\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/5548a812a85610be2e9f01205ae6da05.webm?t=1788537373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/5548a812a85610be2e9f01205ae6da05.mp4?t=1788537373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >活着逃出鬼屋</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个房间都有东西在等着你。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可能是怪物、陷阱、诡异的危险、好用的物品，也可能是那些死了以后居然还在上班的电视节目工作人员。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收集足够的眼球打开前进的道路，能用的东西都别放过，然后继续寻找出口。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >走得越远，这栋房子就越要命。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]好好演一场[/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你不只是要活下来。你还在现场直播。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >快速干掉敌人可以赚到更多钱。看来杀戮很受观众欢迎！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >节目播音员会一直跟着你的表现。顺利时替你喝彩，出丑时也绝不会让任何人错过。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]下一扇门后面有什么？[/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你永远不知道这栋房子接下来准备了什么。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一个房间里可能挤满怪物。下一个房间里可能是陷阱、好用的武器、奇怪的奖励，或者一个准备提前结束节目的 Boss。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >继续前进，能找到什么就用什么，并做好面对下一件事的准备。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/94f949e6d1a82c5844c53b282a2a3001.poster.avif?t=1788537373\" aria-label=\"Scene where the player enters the mid boss room.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/94f949e6d1a82c5844c53b282a2a3001.webm?t=1788537373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/94f949e6d1a82c5844c53b282a2a3001.mp4?t=1788537373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >主要特色</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>杀出一个个充满怪物、陷阱和超自然危险的房间。</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收集眼球打开房门，向宅邸更深处前进。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>寻找新武器和临时强化，增加活下去的机会。</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >挑战挡在你和出口之间的危险 Boss。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>快速消灭敌人，赚取更多现金。</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >听电视节目播音员点评你的胜利、失误和死里逃生。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>单人游玩，或与朋友进行本地双人合作。</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >闹鬼豪宅、快节奏动作和荒唐电视游戏节目的疯狂组合。 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>清空鬼屋。赚点钱。给观众来场好戏。</strong></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >欢迎收看电视上最致命的节目</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted House Hellshift 是一款节奏飞快、混乱刺激的俯视角射击游戏。你要一路杀出一座闹鬼的宅邸，而电视机前的观众正在收看现场直播。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >射杀怪物、躲避陷阱、收集眼球打开上锁的门、寻找新武器，然后想办法活着出去。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可以独自游玩，也可以和朋友在同一台电脑上一起玩。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/5548a812a85610be2e9f01205ae6da05.poster.avif?t=1788537373\" aria-label=\"Scene showing 2 player local co-op mode\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/5548a812a85610be2e9f01205ae6da05.webm?t=1788537373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/5548a812a85610be2e9f01205ae6da05.mp4?t=1788537373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >活着逃出鬼屋</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个房间都有东西在等着你。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可能是怪物、陷阱、诡异的危险、好用的物品，也可能是那些死了以后居然还在上班的电视节目工作人员。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收集足够的眼球打开前进的道路，能用的东西都别放过，然后继续寻找出口。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >走得越远，这栋房子就越要命。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]好好演一场[/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你不只是要活下来。你还在现场直播。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >快速干掉敌人可以赚到更多钱。看来杀戮很受观众欢迎！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >节目播音员会一直跟着你的表现。顺利时替你喝彩，出丑时也绝不会让任何人错过。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]下一扇门后面有什么？[/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你永远不知道这栋房子接下来准备了什么。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一个房间里可能挤满怪物。下一个房间里可能是陷阱、好用的武器、奇怪的奖励，或者一个准备提前结束节目的 Boss。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >继续前进，能找到什么就用什么，并做好面对下一件事的准备。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/94f949e6d1a82c5844c53b282a2a3001.poster.avif?t=1788537373\" aria-label=\"Scene where the player enters the mid boss room.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/94f949e6d1a82c5844c53b282a2a3001.webm?t=1788537373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094290/extras/94f949e6d1a82c5844c53b282a2a3001.mp4?t=1788537373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >主要特色</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>杀出一个个充满怪物、陷阱和超自然危险的房间。</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收集眼球打开房门，向宅邸更深处前进。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>寻找新武器和临时强化，增加活下去的机会。</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >挑战挡在你和出口之间的危险 Boss。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>快速消灭敌人，赚取更多现金。</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >听电视节目播音员点评你的胜利、失误和死里逃生。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>单人游玩，或与朋友进行本地双人合作。</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >闹鬼豪宅、快节奏动作和荒唐电视游戏节目的疯狂组合。 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>清空鬼屋。赚点钱。给观众来场好戏。</strong></p>",
 "short_description": "在一座布满怪物和陷阱的鬼屋中杀出一条生路，电视观众正在收看现场直播。收集眼球打开受诅咒的门，找到出口并设法活着逃出去。支持单人游玩或本地双人合作。",
